  "body": "Suppose you have the following code:\r\n\r\n```js\r\nconst c = document.createElement(\"canvas\");\r\nc.width = 500;\r\nc.height = 500;\r\nconst brc = c.getContext(\"bitmaprenderer\");\r\nbrc.transferFromImageBitmap(someImageBitmap);\r\n```\r\n\r\nAnd suppose the `someImageBitmap` has a width of 800 and a height of 800. Should the canvas width and height change as well?",
